<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SpectraLink.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SpectraLink.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist lowered estimates for SpectraLink Q3 ending in September to $0.01 a share from $0.07 and reduced revenue estimates to $5.0 million from $7.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Maintained buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Cited company's statement that Q3 revenues are likely to be significantly below expectations.</p>
</text>
